  "text": "The initiative features a strong partnership with mana whenua, ensuring cultural integration and governance perspectives. It includes the development of a formal Technical Specification for NbS, rapid flood hazard modeling, and a structured regulatory pathway to facilitate implementation. The project is aligned with global standards and aims to enhance the 'investability' of nature-related projects by reducing perceived risks for investors.",
